YulangClosure.PaperTypes.PaperTupleSplitExecution.example_order : YulangClosure.PaperTypes.PaperTupleSplitExecution.splitStep
    (YulangClosure.PaperTypes.Computation.split
      (YulangClosure.PaperTypes.Value.tuple
        [YulangClosure.PaperTypes.Value.literal (YulangClosure.PaperTypes.Literal.integer 7),
          YulangClosure.PaperTypes.Value.literal (YulangClosure.PaperTypes.Literal.boolean Bool.true)])
